WEBVTT

00:00:28.276 --> 00:00:28.872
<v><b>I:</b></v> Hi, Ben.

00:00:30.005 --> 00:00:31.113
<v><b>B:</b></v> Hi, Izzy.

00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:33.906
How’s work?

00:00:35.552 --> 00:00:36.563
<v><b>I:</b></v> It’s OK.

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:38.901
I’m really tired.

00:00:40.576 --> 00:00:41.142
<v><b>B:</b></v> I’m sure.

00:00:42.661 --> 00:00:44.258
What time are you finishing?

00:00:44.756 --> 00:00:48.418
<v><b>I:</b></v> Well, hopefully about six.

00:00:49.590 --> 00:00:54.922
<v><b>B:</b></v> Cool, do you want to meet for a pizza at Pomodora?

00:00:56.782 --> 00:00:57.798
I can book a table.

00:00:59.063 --> 00:01:00.142
<v><b>I:</b></v> Just the two of us?

00:01:01.177 --> 00:01:01.675
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yeah.

00:01:02.505 --> 00:01:05.615
Emma’s meeting some old friends from California this evening.

00:01:06.182 --> 00:01:10.064
<v><b>I:</b></v> Yes! That sounds really nice.

00:01:10.498 --> 00:01:13.843
We haven’t been out together on our own for a long time.

00:01:14.946 --> 00:01:15.561
<v><b>B:</b></v> Awesome.

00:01:15.981 --> 00:01:17.261
Let’s say seven?

00:01:17.749 --> 00:01:18.203
<v><b>I:</b></v> Yeah!

00:01:18.882 --> 00:01:19.439
<v><b>B:</b></v> Perfect.

00:01:19.980 --> 00:01:20.688
See you then.

00:01:21.416 --> 00:01:21.938
<v><b>I:</b></v> Great.

00:01:23.306 --> 00:01:23.916
Can’t wait.

00:01:28.818 --> 00:01:30.424
<v><b>B:</b></v> She says she can’t wait.

00:01:32.236 --> 00:01:33.032
<v><b>E:</b></v> That’s cool.

00:01:34.565 --> 00:01:34.917
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yep.

00:01:36.563 --> 00:01:37.188
We’re really happy.

00:01:38.525 --> 00:01:41.191
<v><b>E:</b></v> Just…be careful, Ben.

00:01:41.865 --> 00:01:42.817
I worry about you.

00:01:43.667 --> 00:01:45.728
<v><b>B:</b></v> You don’t need to worry about me.

00:01:46.084 --> 00:01:48.735
<v><b>E:</b></v> Of course I do! I’m your sister.

00:01:49.297 --> 00:01:50.151
That’s my job.

00:02:29.326 --> 00:02:30.561
<v><b>W:</b></v> Are you ready to order?

00:02:31.494 --> 00:02:33.105
<v><b>B:</b></v> I’m waiting for somebody.

00:02:33.379 --> 00:02:34.346
She’s coming soon.

00:02:35.991 --> 00:02:36.865
<v><b>W:</b></v> Of course.

00:03:00.981 --> 00:03:05.097
Could I take this chair? I need it for another table.

00:03:07.959 --> 00:03:09.141
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yeah, sure.